{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-07_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-07","title":"抵近支援作战","storyCode":"14-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"d436434971c3cbea743d6eb6af9e95af3b44a5a1d620576226e411721eb3da79","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g3_mainbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"行动开始后六十五小时"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵联军和食腐者的战争很惨烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往前走一点，就是银石崖了。源石反应很强烈，载具已经瘫痪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"维娜应该也快到前线了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"典范军任务艰巨。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦诸王之息与剑座合体，我们从这个位置也能看到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“劈开天灾”。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们看到某个无法理解的现象时，常常会夸大它，并在后世的流传中添加更多浪漫元素。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"诸王之息与碎片大厦——","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"维多利亚人的“盾”和“矛”。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"碎片大厦是对源石的应用，与大型巫术装置同级。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"诸王之息却能抵消部分源石反应。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对此已有所意识。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"源石常被人比喻为“痼疾”。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"至今泰拉诸国应对天灾的最佳方法依然是躲避。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"人们很难掌握直接干预源石运作的方法。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"维多利亚人却早早掌握了使用工具自救的办法。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"诸王之息的源头并不在维多利亚吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我第一次看到诸王之息，是在萨尔贡万王之王的宫殿深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们视它为阿斯兰王权的象征，认为它能庇护一个聚落、一座城市。这是事实。它确实具有抵消一定程度源石反应的功能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"只是“一定程度”？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你对它并没有那么在意。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，无论古老的萨尔贡术师多么努力地发掘和改造，它都只是一件曾经的城防装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在它被投入使用的年代，源石还未普遍存在于这片大地之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信它能暂时停下“阿喃那”，为巨兽脊椎创造一个起飞的窗口期，但它不是一个能够停止源石活动的抑制器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"过去这么多年里，你是不是失望了很多次？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，在现在的你眼中，源石是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"充满未知的现象，可供利用的资源，又或者，疾病和灾害的源头？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我没法选。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想选择，因为你想说，“全都是”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石早就和我们所见的一切结合在了一起。环境、科技、文化，还有我们的身躯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一部分肢体坏死了，切割它或许就能解决问题。但假如从头到尾，全都是问题呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"在有些人眼中，你该无所不能。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在看......我？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你问我是否失望过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有那么一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我放任了自己对一个人过于依赖，做出了一系列错误的判断，并付出了代价。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是不是......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"（叹息）","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不意味着，我不会再相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去反抗我们的源头与根基，本就无比艰难。仅仅寄希望于一项技术......或者一个人，是不切实际的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，凯尔希医生，请过来看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前面有一个洞口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......入口被人为隐藏过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"粗糙，扭曲，是赦罪师操弄的幻术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫术祭坛一定就在最深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得往源石反应最强烈的地方走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"到处都是源石。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"源石活性化程度前所未见。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，你怎么样？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有更重要的事情要做。我能坚持的。"}]},{"label":"Logos也是感染者，有没有感觉到异样？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能说自己丝毫未受环境影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但影响我的，恐怕不止源石。"}]},{"label":"凯尔希，我们的药还能起作用吗？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比毫无准备要好得多。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在“阿喃那”的作用下，源石将愈发趋近它的本性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晶簇会以越来越快的速度与所有生灵和死物结合，并以同化的形式将信息封存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石只会以自身的结构来储存信息。因此，被同化的个体将彻底失去原本的生命形态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在旁人看来，就是瞬间的“分解”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像因矿石病发作而死去的人......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些相似。这些病人，在意识消散之后，他们的躯体将在一段时间内崩解为高度活性化的源石粉尘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓的同化，就是把这个过程压缩到极致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的技术只能做到延缓体细胞与源石融合率达到阈值。我们尚做不到生成真正的防御屏障，来阻隔源石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，不必过于忧虑。当前环境中的源石覆盖率还未到极端情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这还不是极端情况？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我很难不忧虑。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前，我们仍能行动和呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"及时阻止源石继续扩散，事情就不至于毫无转圜余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，博士，我听到有敌人的动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，做好迎敌准备。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闯入者？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"是女妖和——\n唔呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守卫人数不少，但是不难解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暗影中必定蛰伏着更庞大的危险。博士，请务必不要与我们走散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受赦罪师巫术干扰，我难以辨别出精确位置——但“提卡兹之血”无疑就在附近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提卡兹的血，唤醒了最初的源石。\n万年来，萨卡兹的命运就这样与源石纠缠到了一起。\n阿米娅和Logos都正在经受痛苦。或者说，他们正是背负着这些痛苦走到了这里。\n那你自己呢？你想起凯尔希的许多次欲言又止。\n你不仅是一个见证者、陪伴者，你与源石、与这场战争，以及正在发生的事，一定也有着更深入的联系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g8_altarcoreandblood"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“提卡兹之血”。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜卡雷的执念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓的纯净之血，不含“杂质”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它本身并不包含任何力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，切断它和祭坛的联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，攻击那边的卫兵尸体！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖啸）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一个Mon3tr？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不止一个，所有倒下的赦罪师卫兵......都不是真正的卫兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几乎没有破绽的“模仿”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有他，才能将这座洞窟......装点得与真正的祭坛一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是专门为我们设置的陷阱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"变形者。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，后退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（愤怒的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mon3tr挡在你们身前。\n而你紧紧拉住阿米娅的手。\n“提卡兹之血”和整座祭坛正在崩塌，四周的岩壁朝你们挤压过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"narration","text":"幻觉消失了，地形的变化却是实实在在的。\n真正的祭坛一定依旧在运作着。源石正在生长，它会吃掉你们所见的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这里是......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......赦罪师的洞窟。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们似乎掉到了刚才那个假祭坛的下层。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石结构的变化速度太快了，我只来得及抓住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生和Logos先生不知道在哪里......到处都是源石，信息太多了。我感觉不到他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他们可能离我们很远了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"敌人想困住我们。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"敌人不想让我们破坏祭坛。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但赦罪师的首要目标，依然可能是你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们想要的，是“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地面在颤动......是晶簇还在蔓延吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从源石深处爬出来的怪物。\n温迪戈的角，石翼魔的身躯，炎魔的火。\n你曾在赦罪师的石像上见过这些特征，来自萨卡兹的不同氏族。\n但它们出现在了同一副躯体上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的情感......很混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有回忆，许多零碎的，模糊的，杂糅的回忆......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，另一边！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，接下来还会有更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座洞窟是他们诞生的地方。"},{"type":"narration","text":"赦罪师用萨卡兹的血和源石制造......\n孕育了这些生物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很......悲伤？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米娅......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，他们是活着的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是石块，也不是纯粹的巫术造物，他们拥有生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们只会听从赦罪师的命令行事。他们并不会感到疼痛，也不会为自身命运哭泣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们只会称这样的生物为......“怪物”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，“怪物”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者说......“奇美拉”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底在为谁哀叹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是为这些无知无觉的同类，还是为你自己——被迫戴上冠冕的，奇美拉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师的“奇美拉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战斗要开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，你有没有受影响？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"又是赦罪师的巫术！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我不会再让赦罪师困住我第二次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻象和噩梦而已，我不该如此脆弱。“奇美拉”的称谓，就和梦中那些诘问一样，我早就听过很多回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我还会感到动摇，就根本不配走到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我绝不会，再一次看着博士被我的不成熟连累。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小小的王冠在卡特斯少女的头顶显现。\n黑色线条在她的五指之间编织成形。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你和“魔王”的联系正在加深。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，依然不够。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别急着离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些分身对我的咒术而言没什么意义，变形者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你曾经说过的那样，“这是浪费时间”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们记得，那次演出，还有那场散步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你陪我们聊了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时与我对话的你，虽然也顶着不同的面貌，但至少还自认王庭之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的你是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们尝试以各种身份生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这些不同的旅程，并未给予我们答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们思考，发现没有起点和终点的路途，只是循环而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已试过以死亡来求证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡的尽头，空无一物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们所说的众魂，并未对我们开口言语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖，你为我们吹响骨哨的时候，是什么感受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“破碎”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无穷无尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的力量？死去一次之后，你明明已经大不如前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"被咒言击溃的分身并未像过去那般，化作泡影。\n那一具具尸首只是倒下了，沉入了翻滚的源石潮中，迅速地消失无踪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紧接着，一只状若枯枝的手从晶簇之中探了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灵幛”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖......你也曾杀死过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在战场上，我与你们立场不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡兹戴尔，我奉命斩杀王庭的叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拦下我的去路，并以咒言令我的头颅与身躯分离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时的你，不过是一个声音稚嫩的幼童。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我记得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你口中的叛徒，只是想要逃离卡兹戴尔，找寻平静生活的一家三口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们本该向王庭宣誓效忠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王庭从不该凌驾于普通萨卡兹之上。即便你曾是卡兹戴尔的战争英雄，我也不能放任你屠戮平民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你选择了巴别塔和特蕾西娅......为了你口中的普通萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是通往未来的，更正确的道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"但在她死后，你也并未回到卡兹戴尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至还帮助那群外族人，一起偷走了“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”的传承是特蕾西娅殿下的决定。我是巴别塔的一员，她的属下，并无置喙资格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你亲手杀死了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"被咒言掐住心脏的时候，哈哈，我都不敢相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"并肩作战那么多年，你对我的感情，竟然还不及对那些外来者的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你留在本舰的那盆黄金草，如今长得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下死后，在那场席卷巴别塔的内乱中，你亲手杀死了多少同僚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"那么多人的遗物......都快占满你的宿舍了吧？每次看着那棵我随手插进盆里的草，你会感到悲伤吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若我确实感觉到了悲伤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是因为，连死亡都未能给予你们应得的安宁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变形者，曾经的你不会如此热衷于扮演“死者”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辩论不能给予你答案，探寻我的感受同样不能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"死者并未回答。\n他们依旧不断地从漆黑的晶簇中钻出来。\n许多面孔，熟悉的，不熟悉的，全部都是萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你天赋的能力，正与源石之中包含的信息发生共鸣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你的力量因源石而增长——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos抬起一只手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无需咒言，仅有轻微的，因岩壁震动而形成的嗡鸣。\n所有的变形者分身都在瞬间破碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个......最后一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔站在洞窟深处，神态与当日立在巨兽颅骨之上时几乎相同。\n只不过，在他周身翻滚的并非往日的鲜血，而是源石晶簇。\nLogos能感受到，自己体内的血在躁动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君......杜卡雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你和其他那些都不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并非变形者的化身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g3_mainbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变形者阁下，这一部分的您选择了帮助奎萨图什塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我们并非想要帮助某一位，我们只是，在寻找答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，当萨卡兹还不是萨卡兹的时候，我们就见过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从我们身上走过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不记得那次会面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时，我们尚不能开口言语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初的提卡兹魔王触碰了源石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我们第一次“醒来”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一个个体，自我们之中站起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们感受到了彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之前，我们已经存在了不知多长时间。直到那一刻，我们才明确了自己的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们开始“思考”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......源石会同化一切接触到源石的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只你们，还有最初的血魔，女妖，温迪戈......所有提卡兹都发生了转变。你们正在趋近另一种曾存在于这片大地的生物形态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（急切的嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它很不喜欢，看到别的自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希......不灭之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得你最初的模样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不灭之人”是一部分人对我的想象和误解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间同样会在我身上留下痕迹。最初的那个名为“凯尔希”的个体，早就湮灭在了黄沙之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你还是你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在特蕾西娅身边重生的时候，我们也在注视着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你与上一个你，从样貌到性格，都有所不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们习惯于为了生存而不断变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在萨卡兹之中，变形者集群也很特殊。我们曾以为，你与我们是相似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们认识很多个“凯尔希”，就如同凯尔希认识很多个我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而变形者从来都是集群。每一个变形者都是我们感受这个世界的接收器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而“凯尔希”不同。每一个凯尔希都是你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实这么认为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是记忆的传承令你如此坚持吗？记忆明明很容易就能被篡改和灌输。我们知道，许多长生者都用过类似手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以这种形式达成的“永生”与谎言无异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，难道是某种职责......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认，从降生那一刻开始，我的生命就与职责相绑定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回顾过往，我不认为......我算是真正“活着”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"构成你身体的物质已经全部被更换过。继承自前代个体的记忆同样并不可靠。被强加的使命未必属于你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，这一万多年来，是什么令你坚信，你始终如一？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr？","speakerId":"npc_10003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个独有的称呼或者代号？很多缺乏关爱的萨卡兹会在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个名字，意味着很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给予我名字的人，还有我在意的人，正身处险境，现在并不是我们交谈的良机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"变形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们想不到，连你也如此感性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋的嚎叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
